WEBVTT

00:12:29.763 --> 00:12:31.724
you can create poetry and music,

00:12:31.748 --> 00:12:34.247
you can create a community
that cares for one another

00:12:34.271 --> 00:12:36.484
and does not allow
those atrocities to happen.

00:12:37.331 --> 00:12:40.212
So the next time
you feel yourself getting angry,

00:12:40.236 --> 00:12:42.236
instead of trying to turn it off,

00:12:42.260 --> 00:12:44.905
I hope you'll listen
to what that anger is telling you.

00:12:44.929 --> 00:12:48.460
And then I hope you'll channel it
into something positive and productive.

00:12:48.785 --> 00:12:49.936
Thank you.

00:12:49.960 --> 00:12:53.460
(Applause)